usage: unitron z80 [-h] {dis,asm,roundtrip} ...

the NGPC's Z80 sound CPU, in Zilog syntax (docs/z80.md)

    dis                 a listing, or (-o DIR) source that assembles back to the same bytes
    asm                 assemble Zilog Z80 source into a raw image at Z80 0x0000
    roundtrip           dis -> asm a Z80 image and compare the bytes
